        "title": "ARC Raiders",
        "extract": "ARC Raiders is a 2025 multiplayer extraction shooter developed and published by Embark Studios. It was released on October 30, 2025 for the platforms PlayStation 5, Windows and Xbox Series X/S, built on the game engine Unreal Engine 5. It can be played solo, or in teams of two or three.\nThe game has received generally favorable reviews from critics, and it was awarded Best Multiplayer Game at The Game Awards 2025 and Online Game of the Year at the 29th Annual D.I.C.E. Awards.",
